  "description": "## 💀 Forgotten Order 💀 - Guild for new players!\n\nWe are a semi-hardcore guild that focuses on fun &amp; steady progression over 5 guilds!\nWe offer an active leadership and plan on being around for a long time.\n\nOur endgame guild (Forgotten) was ranked 🥇 No. 1 in seasonal rankings for Season 5!\n\n### ✨ Features\n- Self-made **world boss timer** via discord\n- Active discord chat (ask any questions you have!)\n- Sometimes we have giveaway-competitions! (Discord needed)\n- Guild armory (Higher skills needed to equip)\n\n### ✔️ Requirements\n- Minimum combat level 40\n- Participate in raids\n- Be active &amp; grow your character!\n- Help fulfill daily guild challenges!\n\n### 📅 Raid Schedule (1 till we have enough marks)\n- **19:00 PM CET** (Level 40 raid)\n\n ### 💬 Discord\n- Discord will soon be mandatory. Please use the &#039;applications&#039; channel in discord to apply.\n- Discord server link: https://discord.gg/kCKdJmckxC\n\n ### 🏰 Other Forgotten Guilds\n- Forgotten CL 100\n- Forgotten Watch CL 92\n- Forgotten Vanguard CL 80\n- Forgotten Dawn CL 60\n- Forgotten Tavern (POOL GUILD)\n\n**Welcome to the Forgotten.**\nWe are recruiting! Simply apply to a Forgotten guild within your CL, if no spot is available apply in a lower level subsidiary.",
